From: RK3128 reference <reference@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: enable validated RK3128 DMA and shared health-tested RNG

Register native AES/DES/EDE/hash DMA with separate private
coherent buffers.
Use the validated upper-DDR, no-BLOCK_FLUSH recipe and bounded completion.
Preserve oscillator health tests under one owner and hold lifetime clocks.
Guard both probes against retained PMU idle; refuse runtime gating.
Set priorities and CPU fallbacks from measured requester/worker CPU time.

Signed-off-by: RK3128 reference <reference@example.invalid>

